    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gary Nel of Leonard Wilson Keenan Estate & Letting Agents is delighted to present No. 88 Bride Valley View, Upper Fairview, Cork, T23 Y1T9 new to the market.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully maintained two-bedroom mid-terrace residence is presented in excellent condition throughout and enjoys a superb position overlooking a large open green area in this mature and highly sought-after residential neighbourhood on Cork's north side.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious and well laid out. Upon entering the property, you are welcomed by a bright entrance hallway leading to two elegant reception rooms, both featuring attractive fireplaces that create a warm and inviting atmosphere. To the rear of the home is a separate fully fitted kitchen with granite worktops, offering excellent storage and preparation space, together with direct access to the substantial enclosed private rear garden, providing the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property comprises two generous double bedrooms, both complete with fitted mirrored sliding wardrobes, together with a modern family bathroom.\r\n\r\nExternally, the home benefits from an extended front patio overlooking the large open green area, secure on sight parking for one vehicle, and an impressive enclosed rear garden offering excellent outdoor space.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, with Cork City Centre just minutes away. Residents enjoy easy access to a superb range of local amenities including Blackpool Shopping Centre, supermarkets, cafés, schools, sports clubs and excellent public transport links. The N20, N22 and Cork's main road network are all within easy reach, making commuting straightforward.\r\n\r\nThis turnkey property will appeal to first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, and investors seeking a quality home in a highly convenient location.\r\nBer energy rating C.\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• Beautifully maintained two-bedroom mid-terrace home\r\n• Presented in excellent condition throughout\r\n• Entrance hallway\r\n• Overlooking a large open green area\r\n• Two reception rooms, both with feature fireplaces\r\n• Separate fully fitted kitchen with granite worktops\r\n• Large enclosed rear garden\r\n• Two generous double bedrooms with fitted mirrored sliding wardrobes\r\n• Modern family bathroom\r\n• Front patio with attractive open views\r\n• Secure off-street parking for one vehicle\r\n• Excellent location close to Cork City Centre, Blackpool Shopping Centre and a host of local amenities"
      },
